  "definition": "Report and Notification of a Dose to an Embryo/Fetus or a Nursing Child",
  "effectiveDate": "2022-10-25",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for He-P 4035) #6942, eff 2-1-99; ss by #8800, INTERIM, eff 2-1-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-07 New. #8959, eff 8-7-07; ss by #10897, INTERIM, eff 7-22-15, EXPIRES: 1-18-16; ss by #11011, eff 1-15-16; amd by #12054, eff 11-19-16; ss by #13473, eff 10-25-22",
